# Adam Smith gates the factory rows (FUN_15eb_3650 raw 13707-13711: Arsenal, Textile Mill, Cigar Factory,
# Rum Factory, Fur Factory, Iron Works need FF 0).
# Start: colony_change_construction's input (France, 1599; Quebec pop 6, Lumber Mill in production).
# Fixture (sav_json): Quebec owns the Fur Trading Post (fur_traders_house bits 3 = House + Post) and France
# owns Adam Smith (founding_fathers bit 0, count 6). Fur Factory (min pop 6, catalog row 34) is listed
# right above Lumber Mill.
click 168 128              # open Quebec (map tile 45,24)
wait 1
key c                      # construction picker opens on Lumber Mill
wait 1
key Up                     # one row up: Fur Factory
wait 1
key Return                 # commit: Fur Factory becomes Quebec's project (building_in_production 34)
wait 1
key Escape                 # back to the map
wait 1
